        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ yu Yeova ũla wakũmbie, we Yakovo, na ũla wakũmbie, we Isilaeli, easya atĩĩ: Ndũkakĩe, nũndũ nĩnĩkwovoetye; nĩnĩkwĩtĩte na syĩtwa yaku, wĩ wakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
